belluikit/systray
=================

This product is a modified version of fyne-io/systray
(https://github.com/fyne-io/systray), which is itself a fork of
getlantern/systray (https://github.com/getlantern/systray). Both are licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the full text is in LICENSE.

Modifications made in this fork (per Section 4(b) of the Apache License):

- 2026: the Go module path was changed from fyne.io/systray to
  github.com/belluikit/systray, and the import paths in systray_unix.go,
  systray_menu_unix.go, systray_notifier_unix.go and example/main.go were
  updated to match. README.md was edited to describe the fork.

The fork is maintained for Bellui (https://bellui.com). Copyright in the
original files remains with their respective authors.
